      "writtenOn": "2025-04-03T17:28:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "They can be found in [src/dawn/native/BUILD.GN](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/BUILD.gn;l\u003d543). Specifically, these lines. \n\n```GN\n  if (dawn_enable_d3d12) {\n    if (dawn_use_built_dxc) {\n      deps +\u003d [ \"$dawn_root/third_party/gn/dxc:dxcompiler\" ]\n      defines +\u003d [ \"DAWN_USE_BUILT_DXC\" ]\n      data_deps +\u003d [ \"$dawn_root/third_party/gn/dxc:copy_dxil_dll\" ]\n    }\n```\n\nHere is the definition of [dxc:copy_dxil_dll](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/third_party/gn/dxc/BUILD.gn;l\u003d2419)\n\n```GN\n# Define a target to copy the DXIL signing library, dxil.dll, to the output directory\nif (is_win) {\n  import(\"//build/config/win/visual_studio_version.gni\")\n  copy(\"copy_dxil_dll\") {\n    sources \u003d\n        [ \"$windows_sdk_path/bin/$windows_sdk_version/$target_cpu/dxil.dll\" ]\n    outputs \u003d [ \"$root_out_dir/{{source_file_part}}\" ]\n  }\n}\n```",
